            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Powerful Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n30 feet. A creature that enters the area must attempt a DC 26 Fortitude save.\n\nOn a failure, the creature is sickened 2, and on a critical failure, the creature is also slowed 1 for as long as it is sickened. While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to all xulgaths' stenches for 1 minute."
            },
